            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Grant Newell"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made this for the first tonight. \nSub the olives for sundried tomatoes and used the cheery tomatoes we had on hand (didn't seed them). \nLove the flavors and the lemon juice isn't over powering, everything comes together nicely. Will go great with chicken sausage or whatever protein side.",
            "datePublished": "2020-08-25T23:47:17.227Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
