            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "buffalo, NY"
            },
            "reviewBody": "A terrific recipe. This was a last-minute choice so of necessity I had to make a few substitutions. But we loved them. Home grown tomatoes were gone, so I used Bella Sun Luci Sun dried julienne cut tomatoes with Italian herbs. This gave the orzo a wonderful flavor. No Kalamatas so used regular black olives, sliced, and cut back on the lemon juice as others suggested. Will make the recipe this same way next time.",
            "datePublished": "2010-10-11T18:17:57.860Z"
          },
