            "reviewBody": "The only original change I made was to cut the lemon juice in half (based on so many reviewers who said the original amount was too much). I would have liked it better had I not of chopped the tomatoes and olives as small as I did. Prior to serving I tasted it, after it had set for several hours, and I felt it was bland so I ended up having to add ingredients to \"jazz it up\". Sorry, but it is not a recipe I would make again.",
